{"id":"darstellen","lemma":"darstellen","pos":"verb","rank":4879,"glosses":["to depict; represent","to personate","to pose"],"ipa":"/ˈdaːʁˌʃtɛlən/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d3/De-darstellen.ogg/De-darstellen.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"present":{"1s":"stelle dar","1p":"stellen dar","2s":"stellst dar","2p":"stellt dar","3s":"stellt dar","3p":"stellen dar"},"preterite":{"1s":"stellte dar","1p":"stellten dar","2s":"stelltest dar","2p":"stelltet dar","3s":"stellte dar","3p":"stellten dar"},"perfect":{"1s":"habe dargestellt","1p":"haben dargestellt","2s":"hast dargestellt","2p":"habt dargestellt","3s":"hat dargestellt","3p":"haben dargestellt"},"future":{"1s":"werde darstellen","1p":"werden darstellen","2s":"wirst darstellen","2p":"werdet darstellen","3s":"wird darstellen","3p":"werden darstellen"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"stell dar","2p":"stellt dar"}},"subjunctive":{"conditional":{"1s":"würde darstellen","1p":"würden darstellen","2s":"würdest darstellen","2p":"würdet darstellen","3s":"würde darstellen","3p":"würden darstellen"}}},"nonFinite":{"participle":"dargestellt"},"examples":[{"text":"Das wird überhaupt gar kein Problem darstellen.","en":"That won't be any problem at all.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"overall, in general"},{"g":"at all"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"no problem"]]},{"text":"Das Telefon kann eine Belästigung darstellen.","en":"The telephone can be a nuisance.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"telephone"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"harassment"},null]},{"text":"Das war einfacher, als Tom es dargestellt hat.","en":"That was easier to do than Tom said it would be.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"easy","l":"einfach"},{"g":"at the same moment"},null,{"g":"it"},null,{"g":"has","l":"haben"}]},{"text":"Heilige werden immer mit einem Heiligenschein über dem Kopf dargestellt.","en":"Saints are always depicted with a halo over their heads.","words":[{"g":"holy","l":"heilig"},{"g":"to become"},{"g":"at all times without…"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"(to) a","l":"ein"},{"g":"aureola, aureole"},{"g":"[with accusative or…"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},{"g":"head"},null]},{"text":"Tom wird kein Problem darstellen.","en":"Tom won't be a problem.","words":[null,{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[2,4,"no problem"]]}]}